.TH SDL_HINT_INVALID_PARAM_CHECKS 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_INVALID_PARAM_CHECKS \- Set the level of checking for invalid parameters passed to SDL functions.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_INVALID_PARAM_CHECKS \(dqSDL_INVALID_PARAM_CHECKS\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The variable can be set to the following values:
.PP

\(bu \(dq1\(dq: Enable fast parameter error checking, e\[char46]g\[char46] quick NULL checks, etc\[char46]
.PP
\(bu \(dq2\(dq: Enable full parameter error checking, e\[char46]g\[char46] validating objects are the correct type, etc\[char46] (default)
.PP
This hint can be set anytime\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This hint is available since SDL 3\[char46]4\[char46]0\[char46]

